  "prefLabel": "Stra 1105.02 Non New Hampshire Scholar GPA Requirement",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-02",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Stra 1105.02 Non New Hampshire Scholar GPA Requirement. Scholarship recipients who have a received a scholarship award of $1,000.00 per year shall maintain at least a 2.0 cumulative GPA, verified by the institution on an annual basis in order to retain their scholarship.\n\nSource. #12446, INTERIM, eff 1-3-18, EXPIRES: 7-2-18; ss by #12550, eff 6-19-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/stra1100.html"
